And once it strikes your
night, your soul is mine.

252
00:17:32,320 --> 00:17:34,360
Staring at your deck won't help.

253
00:17:34,560 --> 00:17:36,577
You have to actually play something.

254
00:17:36,660 --> 00:17:38,460
Is that so? Fight!

255
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:41,960
Dark magician girl.

256
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:48,000
Pharaoh, both of our
worlds are in great danger.

257
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:50,957
For soon the great beast will awaken.

258
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:52,320
You're our only hope.

259
00:17:53,860 --> 00:17:57,800
I made you a promise, and
I won't go back on my word.

260
00:17:59,580 --> 00:18:01,720
I place one card face down.

261
00:18:02,060 --> 00:18:03,178
Now it's your move.

262
00:18:03,420 --> 00:18:04,300
Very well.

263
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:10,140
First, I discard ten cards from my
deck so my new monster can attack.

264
00:18:11,660 --> 00:18:13,300
Divine Serpent, go!

265
00:18:13,860 --> 00:18:15,740
Strike down one of his knights!

266
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:26,360
Tobias, no!

267
00:18:28,420 --> 00:18:30,180
And then there were two.

268
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:36,660
But more importantly, you just
lost the rest of your life points.

269
00:18:36,900 --> 00:18:38,520
So the duel is over.

270
00:18:38,900 --> 00:18:40,600
As is your existence.

271
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:42,580
So fare thee well.

272
00:18:46,360 --> 00:18:47,340
What's this?

273
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:49,200
You should be gone!

274
00:18:52,120 --> 00:18:54,360
Tell me, how did you survive?

275
00:18:54,900 --> 00:18:55,730
It's simple.

276
00:18:56,060 --> 00:18:58,520
You told me to play a card, so I did.

277
00:18:59,080 --> 00:19:01,840
It's a powerful trap known as Relay Sword.

278
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:03,946
When my life points hit zero,

279
00:19:04,080 --> 00:19:06,237
it allowed me to stay in
the game by summoning my

280
00:19:06,320 --> 00:19:09,900
dark magician girl and
putting my fate in her hands.

281
00:19:11,460 --> 00:19:14,400
So you and I are in
the same situation now.

282
00:19:14,760 --> 00:19:16,620
Each of us has one monster.

283
00:19:17,420 --> 00:19:21,180
You have your serpent, and
I have Dark Magician Girl.

284
00:19:22,380 --> 00:19:25,320
When one is destroyed,
the cardholder will lose.

285
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:29,540
All right.

286
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,780
Let the final phase begin.

287
00:19:32,260 --> 00:19:34,300
Yes, but understand this.

288
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:37,480
You may have altered
the rules of our battle,

289
00:19:37,800 --> 00:19:41,180
but your chances of
victory are just as slim.

290
00:19:42,300 --> 00:19:45,500
I have the spirits of my
friends to support me, Darts.

291
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:49,122
But you, on the other
hand, are completely alone.

292
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:52,357
I possess more power
than you or your friends.

293
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:54,600
And I'll prove it by playing this.

294
00:19:55,480 --> 00:19:56,760
Impact Revive.

295
00:19:57,520 --> 00:20:00,780
It brings back a monster
that was destroyed this turn.

296
00:20:01,040 --> 00:20:03,640
And gives it an extra 500 attack points.

297
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:11,780
That's my card.

298
00:20:12,040 --> 00:20:13,800
Why did you revive Tomaeus?

299
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:19,880
I thought it would be fun to prove
how powerless you truly are Oh,

300
00:20:19,980 --> 00:20:25,400
and one more thing Impact Revive also
lets my monster attack one more time

301
00:20:26,700 --> 00:20:29,860
I send ten cards from
my deck to my graveyard

302
00:20:30,520 --> 00:20:33,920
Now, Divine Serpent, end this duel

303
00:20:42,540 --> 00:20:44,840
His soul is mine.

304
00:20:45,340 --> 00:20:48,900
If she's destroyed, all hope is lost.
